{"Title":"An Act relative to the use of shotgun ammunition for hunting","BillNumber":"H926","DocketNumber":"HD2709","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"JDZ1","Name":"Jonathan D. Zlotnik","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JDZ1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T14:19:07.507"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"JDZ1","Name":"Jonathan D. Zlotnik","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JDZ1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T14:19:07.5066667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H926/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Zlotnik of Gardner, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 926) of Jonathan D. Zlotnik relative to the use of shotgun ammunition for hunting.  Environment and Natural Resources.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 66 of chapter 131 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2016 Official Edition, is hereby amended by striking the section in its entirety and replacing it with the following:-\r\n\t\"Section 66. The director, under the control of the board, may promulgate regulations for the use and possession of shotgun ammunition types for the purposes of hunting.\"\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J21","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J21"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}